4.desc:
After activating a Chain Attack or Ultimate, within 15s, Astra Yao can trigger a Quick Assist even if she does not have Chords. When the attack hits an enemy, the interval for triggering a Quick Assist is reduced to 1s.
While in the Idyllic Cadenza state, when other squad members enter the field via a Quick Assist, they will receive different buffs based on their specialty, and this effect can be triggered once every 3s for the entire squad:
Attack: The next Quick Assist heavy attack on an enemy will deal extra DMG equal to 300% of Astra Yao's ATK;
Anomaly: The next Quick Assist will have 50% increased Anomaly Buildup;
Stun: The next Quick Assist will inflict 50% increased Daze.

1.desc:
When Remie enters the battlefield, she gains the maximum number of Special [Void Glare] based on her own attributes. In Investigation Zone mode, this effect can trigger once every 180 seconds;
When a Character triggers the [Luminize] effect, ignore the target's 50% All-Attribute RES;
When activating [Assist: Feather Wheel Dance], gain 200 Decibels. This effect can trigger at most once every 18 seconds.

6.desc:
When Remie uses [Basic Attack: Cascading Rainbow] and [Basic Attack: Falling Feather], she triggers the [Luminize] effect 2 times;
If the 4th hit of [Basic Attack] lands on a target, after the skill ends, Remie gains 3 special [Phantom Radiance]. The DMG dealt by special [Phantom Radiance] obtained this way is 25% of the special [Phantom Radiance] gained upon entering the battlefield;
In [Additional Ability], the number of [Anomaly] Characters required is reduced by 1.
